  "purpose": "R15L (HBMc/COLL-GQ 10-22, PD-AUDIT gq_issue C2 must-do: landed seams between the regions) on hcoll_gq_issue_k14y_1021: 3 related phase-0 CTS roots = regions: clk = core (centre band, all ports), clk_a0 = quantiser u_aq0 (W SRAM stack + its flops), clk_a1 = u_aq1 (E stack). Every seam is a registered same-edge crossing (core aq_v/aq_x -> aq S0; aq output registers -> core aq_vo_q/aq_q_q/aq_ebc/aq_fault_q), timed by ordinary STA (related_same_frequency); 0 edges on every data path. Region resets land through one ot_rst_relay per aq root (+3 release edges inside aq only). Replaces the single 28.7k-sink root + k-means split (gate_k13r: 28,755 sinks one root). Outline/macros/pins otherwise = hcoll_gq_issue_k14y_1021.",
